WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
It's impossible to get fired in Japan,

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:06.040
but companies found something way worse.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.560
Imagine your boss walks you past your

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:10.480
desk to a tiny room with no computer and

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.000
no work. Just a ticking clock and a guy

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.720
[music] with his feet up scrolling on

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
his phone like he's on vacation. "Your

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:17.520
new job," your boss says, "is nothing.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.400
Just sit here until 6:00." And you're

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:22.040
thinking, "Wait, I'm getting paid for

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.680
this?" At first, it's paradise. Then,

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.840
your coworker starts staring when you

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.600
walk past. The emails stop, and your old

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:29.680
desk already has someone else's family

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.680
photos on it. Every Friday, your boss

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:33.080
pops his head in with a big smile to ask

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.640
how you're enjoying your new role.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.400
Still, the guy in the corner has been

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:38.440
doing [music] this for 3 years and looks

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.000
happier than anyone in the building. So,

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:41.880
if they want to pay you to do nothing,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.280
fine. You kick your feet up right next

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:46.240
to him. Then, one Monday, you walk in

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:48.040
and he's gone. His chair is pushed in,

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.600
his desk is cleared, [music] and nobody

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:51.840
will tell you where he went. You see,

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.520
Japanese law makes it almost impossible

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.520
to fire someone, but there's no law

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:57.640
against making them miserable. So, they

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:59.800
take away your work and your friends and

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:02.440
just wait, because nobody can do nothing

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.440
forever.

